ío hasta la fecha. Obligados a buscar el equilibrio entre su papel de héroes y sus fuertes vínculos familiares, tendrán que defender la Tierra de un hambriento dios espacial llamado Galactus y su intrigante heraldo, Estela Plateada.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Ciencia ficción","Aventura","Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/617126","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:55.176Z"},{"id":"movie-940009","slug":"movie-940009","title":"Ray Gunn","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rpP29aOKpHy1FhX8OZQdUICEs2j.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Ciencia ficción","Crimen","Misterio"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/940009","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:55.528Z"},{"id":"movie-1284016","slug":"movie-1284016","title":"Letras robadas","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oYqsgYCaPjCvd3NPE43yNbhgCtG.jpg","synopsis":"Rick, un cantante de bodas venido a menos, y Danny, una estrella de una 'boy band' en decadencia, forjan una amistad gracias a la música y a una improvisada sesión nocturna. Cuando Danny convierte la canción de Rick en un éxito, Rick se propone recuperar el reconocimiento que cree merecer.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Música","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1284016","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:55.875Z"},{"id":"movie-1147572","slug":"movie-1147572","title":"Narnia: El Sobrino del Mago","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5qVKTxZ40Zn0Ke2SPw79CtKuG3N.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Post Production","country":null,"genres":["Fantasía","Aventura","Familia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1147572","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2027,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:56.222Z"},{"id":"movie-1381