arrera. Aunque Edu odia a su padre por haberle abandonado, sabe que sólo con él puede llegar a alcanzar su sueño. Edu se someterá al estricto control de preparación que le exige Antonio, el cual incluye dejar a un lado el amor… Hasta que conoce a Luna, una joven artista que acaba de abrir un salón de tatuajes justo debajo de su casa.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Romance"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1357449","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:20:16.034Z"},{"id":"movie-1151265","slug":"movie-1151265","title":"La Fille dans les nuages","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o4V7Kq7KJhbjgPpzIYYBzfie77o.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Aventura","Fantasía"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1151265","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:20:16.383Z"},{"id":"movie-1748007","slug":"movie-1748007","title":"Niu Lai","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eum2kcqFr665SgnFulgO7b2lRwW.jpg","synopsis":"Una animación sobre una ternera llamada Niu Lai que crece hasta convertirse en un guerrero.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Familia","Animación"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1748007","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:20:16.740Z"},{"id":"movie-1204010","slug":"movie-1204010","title":"Strana axê","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d3bxJDUTPHEoUcJtj3A3Au4sbRo.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1204010","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:20:17.091Z"},{"id":"movie-1747034","slug":"movie-1747034","title":"Agadha","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jc8tGN6w8Gc6yGkELxfUZAYQqYz.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"g