abeth, navegando en medio de la traición, la felonía y mares salvajes, deben seguir adelante rumbo a Singapur y enfrentarse al astuto pirata chino Sao Feng. Ahora, en los mismísimos confines de la tierra, todos ellos deben elegir un bando en la batalla final, ya que no sólo sus vidas y fortunas, sino también el futuro de la piratería clásica, pende de un hilo...","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Fantasía","Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/285","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2007,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:02.685Z"},{"id":"movie-1280611","slug":"movie-1280611","title":"పరధ","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nCo9QiSaW9KziUCMip6rWyZCgqK.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1280611","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:03.036Z"},{"id":"movie-13494","slug":"movie-13494","title":"Red Sonja","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aE3yh4y0h96CZZpLo0UDFMWZAA9.jpg","synopsis":"Nueva adaptación del cómic Red Sonja, una guerrera vengativa conocida como \"La diablesa con una espada\".","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Acción","Fantasía"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/13494","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:03.383Z"},{"id":"movie-62","slug":"movie-62","title":"2001. Una odisea del espacio","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pGabanxaE2YvN4jhZuSN3oXO0mi.jpg","synopsis":"Mientras investigan la aparición de misteriosos monolitos en el universo, dos astronautas luchan contra la inteligencia artificial de su nave.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Ciencia ficción","Misterio","Aventura"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/62","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":1968,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:03.732Z"},{"i