:"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":1988,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:20.681Z"},{"id":"movie-43074","slug":"movie-43074","title":"Cazafantasmas","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8RInPTtQ8Ysdv9QScY9obSMeF4z.jpg","synopsis":"Manhattan, Nueva York. Después de casi treinta años sin saber de ellos, los fantasmas y demonios se han vuelto a escapar de los infiernos para destruir la ciudad. Esta vez un nuevo equipo de Cazafantasmas, formado por un grupo de cuatro mujeres, está dispuesto a terminar con cualquier amenaza espectral.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Fantasía","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/43074","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2016,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:21.031Z"},{"id":"movie-11324","slug":"movie-11324","title":"Shutter Island","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/56utveUWJwmG12YU7c2zKw6pbRZ.jpg","synopsis":"Verano de 1954. Los agentes judiciales Teddy Daniels y Chuck Aule son destinados a una remota isla del puerto de Boston para investigar la desaparición de una peligrosa asesina recluida en el hospital psiquiátrico Ashecliffe, un centro penitenciario para criminales perturbados dirigido por el siniestro doctor John Cawley. Pronto descubrirán que el centro guarda muchos secretos, y que la isla esconde algo más peligroso que los pacientes.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Suspense","Misterio"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/11324","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2010,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:21.382Z"},{"id":"movie-1383190","slug":"movie-1383190","title":"Black Sheeps","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xEmGDLHE5vk7x3Swsjg3DsivnpG.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1383190","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:21.731Z"},{"id":"movie-18239","slug":"movie-18239","title":"La saga Crepúsculo: Luna nueva","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l5lF8VHTO5QKObAKE3Wp2QQfGZJ.jpg","synopsis":"Edward Cullen decide abandonar a Bella Swan para mantenerla alejada de los peligros del mundo vampírico. Con la ayuda de Jacob Black, su amigo de la infancia y miembro de la misteriosa tribu quileute, Bella intentará superar el abandono de Edward, que la ha dejado sumida en el mayor de los desconsuelos. Pero los peligros siguen acechando a la joven; nuevas y asombrosas criaturas sobrenaturales se cruzarán en su camino, y Bella sólo contará con el apoyo del cada vez más cercano e irresistible Jacob. Repentinamente, Bella se encuentra inmersa en el mundo de los hombres lobo, ancestrales enemigos de los vampiros, y su lealtad es puesta a prueba...","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Fantasía","Drama","Romance"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/18239","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2009,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:22.081Z"},{"id":"movie-1421967","slug":"movie-1421967","title":"Changer l'Eau des Fleurs","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oCTRbUsPCACAWf799j8kXKvhmnk.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1421967","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:22.437Z"},{"id":"movie-1510688","slug":"movie-1510688","title":"Call Me Mother","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kMc1VvhyRdK9w43jaurzfxmnH4x.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1510688","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:22.788Z"},{"id":"movie-1598766","slug":"movie-1598766","title":"クレヨンしんちゃん 奇々怪々！オラの妖怪バケ～ション","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/15iwqqJVgFfeFh4Y1f8gg9yi2Fw.jpg","synopsis":null,"status