en emboscada. Y luego todos los demás: los napolitanos, hombres y mujeres, observados y amados, desilusionados y vitales, sus olas de melancolía, sus ironías trágicas y sus miradas abatidas. La vida, ordinaria o memorable, sabe ser muy larga. El paso del tiempo ofrece un vasto repertorio de emociones. Y ahí al fondo, tan cerca y tan lejos, está Nápoles, esa ciudad inefable que hechiza, encanta, grita, ríe y siempre sabe cómo hacerte daño.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1109255","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2024,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:24.223Z"},{"id":"movie-1792019","slug":"movie-1792019","title":"Untitled Cyberpunk 2077 Film","image":null,"synopsis":null,"status":"Rumored","country":null,"genres":["Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1792019","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":null,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:24.578Z"},{"id":"movie-628847","slug":"movie-628847","title":"Trap House","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p9zbrDpAKyj3jeemkyAoBmlo3KG.jpg","synopsis":"Un agente de la DEA y su compañero persiguen un peculiar grupo de ladrones: sus propios hijos adolescentes rebeldes, que han empezado a robar a un peligroso cártel, utilizando para ello las tácticas de sus padres y la información de alto secreto.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Crimen","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/628847","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:24.964Z"},{"id":"movie-762441","slug":"movie-762441","title":"Un lugar tranquilo: Día uno","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6efQJ7pu9GPketUDBAhJtgZLkvD.jpg","synopsis":"Una mujer llamada Sam trata de sobrevivir a una invasión en la ciudad de Nueva York por criaturas alienígenas sedientas de sangre con oídos ultrasónicos. Tercera entrega de la saga y precuela de las dos anteriores.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Ciencia ficción","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/762441","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2024,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:25.314Z"},{"id":"movie-1284041","slug":"movie-1284041","title":"La última casa","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/CIGQ7ONbNaSDK3KGkXjBILcj1d.jpg","synopsis":"Una familia encerrada en su casa misteriosamente tendrá que unirse para sobrevivir a la escasez de recursos y a la siniestra amenaza que no los deja salir.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Ciencia ficción","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1284041","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:25.661Z"},{"id":"movie-1712326","slug":"movie-1712326","title":"Land of Wolves","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/znWUESPFa1QlvHii4Zc6d0pUxmH.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Bélica"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1712326","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:26.007Z"},{"id":"movie-1443762","slug":"movie-1443762","title":"El falsificador","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bJFvxY8S3kM7h2ScWhfVozROstF.jpg","synopsis":"En este drama inspirado en hechos reales, un joven artista se convierte en un gran falsificador que trabaja con criminales de los barrios más siniestros de la Roma de los años 70.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Suspense","Crimen","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1443762","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:26:26.374Z"},{"id":"movie-1322379","slug":"movie-1322379","title":"รินรดา","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/BXnuRoEwzUqZ8cMdGXl6hRibby.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":nul