ilidades a Tesla. Y no es el único incidente. Impactantes imágenes de cámaras de seguridad muestran la peligrosidad de los coches y, después, un empleado filtra miles de documentos con quejas de los usuarios.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Documental"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1567688","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:29:20.116Z"},{"id":"movie-1545360","slug":"movie-1545360","title":"Generál Golian","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A4PuRauX4hwYeTtq5MF2DFIBw41.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Historia","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1545360","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:29:20.468Z"},{"id":"movie-1399699","slug":"movie-1399699","title":"花まんま","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/laOooa8zpSX9ZTPpbt1byhVuBlg.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1399699","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:29:20.817Z"},{"id":"movie-1249289","slug":"movie-1249289","title":"Doble espionaje","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/chIQxgimGbIFnuFsLqpcoTbsH9.jpg","synopsis":"Un matrimonio de espías, en el punto de mira de una red de inteligencia internacional, no se detendrá ante nada para obtener un activo crítico. Joe y Lara son agentes que viven fuera de la red y cuyo tranquilo retiro en una estación invernal salta por los aires cuando miembros de la vieja guardia sospechan que ambos pueden haberse unido a un equipo de élite de espías deshonestos, conocido como Alarum.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Crimen","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1249289","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:29:21.167Z"},{"id":"movie-1165642","sl