s diferencias para proteger su reino y salvar a la familia de Aquaman, y al mundo, de una destrucción irreversible.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Aventura","Fantasía"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/572802","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2023,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:30:29.555Z"},{"id":"movie-93456","slug":"movie-93456","title":"Gru 2. Mi villano favorito","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hhksXOBVJ6Mu2BwAFgPJwZxNisd.jpg","synopsis":"La película de animación de los estudios Universal, giraba en torno a una apacible y colorida población en la que vivía el malvado Gru. Ayudado por su batallón de Minions, unos pequeños seres de color amarillo, intentaron robar la Luna, aunque no todo acabó como esperaban. Tres niñas curiosas y algo traviesas se cruzaron en su camino, entorpeciéndole todos sus planes y conviertiendo su objetivo en una alocada hazaña interestelar.  Ahora, 'Gru, mi villano favorito 2', narra una nueva aventura en la que Gru volverá a estar acompañado de simpáticos humanoides.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Comedia","Familia","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/93456","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2013,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:30:29.907Z"},{"id":"movie-1596294","slug":"movie-1596294","title":"Paralyzed by Hope: The Maria Bamford Story","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/waH2eiMaEW987JUTWyrj4x4d63k.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Documental"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1596294","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:30:30.255Z"},{"id":"movie-1629056","slug":"movie-1629056","title":"Dead Format","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kVy77Wnzr3f8wkZBLzBvKFNMpCE.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":[],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net