 suicidio o de un homicidio. Sandra es arrestada y juzgada por asesinato, y el proceso pone su tumultuosa relación y su ambigua personalidad en el punto de mira.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Suspense","Misterio","Crimen"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/915935","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2023,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:32:34.900Z"},{"id":"movie-1513581","slug":"movie-1513581","title":"Plötzlich Schwester","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7RqTMvPUtieCq5vFtnxSFORBXnE.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Película de TV","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1513581","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:32:35.251Z"},{"id":"movie-1632933","slug":"movie-1632933","title":"Nhà Mình Đi Thôi","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eWSFLuz0uyA8eYwKzQoVtO1pN43.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Familia","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1632933","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:32:35.595Z"},{"id":"movie-1400382","slug":"movie-1400382","title":"Predators","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jq9BGaBpGmlrJJsFEMAVlfpLkYh.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Documental","Crimen"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1400382","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:32:35.941Z"},{"id":"movie-36586","slug":"movie-36586","title":"Blade II","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4upKg9wQ6P86CjSlqI7wQ3ZM3Dz.jpg","synopsis":"Una nueva raza de vampiros, los Reapers, surge para atacar tanto a los humanos como a los de su propia raza, causando el terror. El Consejo de la Sombra, un grupo de vampiros que teme por su supervivencia y que tiene su sede en Praga, contacta con Blade para que acabe con ellos.","stat