mdb.org/t/p/w300/fMqXNNgzTaxalU1ve9KevpELiGe.jpg","synopsis":"En esta tercera entrega de la saga Transformers, los Autobots y los Decepticons se ven envueltos en una peligrosa carrera espacial en la Tierra entre Estados Unidos y Rusia, donde un acontecimiento amenaza con provocar una guerra tan grande que ni los propios transformers puede que sean capaces de salvar nuestro planeta. Y una vez más, como casi siempre, Sam Witwicky se encuentra involuntariamente en medio del conflicto.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Ciencia ficción","Aventura"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/38356","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2011,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:34:43.440Z"},{"id":"movie-1376412","slug":"movie-1376412","title":"La Guerre des prix","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vyjgmwVgSn10aqDojeztAwnDqWL.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Suspense","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1376412","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:34:43.790Z"},{"id":"movie-1185537","slug":"movie-1185537","title":"Das Geheimnis der gestohlenen Maske","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yWDjqljbcCyk3xod7wVXTPiumTf.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Fantasía","Familia","Aventura"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1185537","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:34:44.189Z"},{"id":"movie-1089598","slug":"movie-1089598","title":"敦煌英雄","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zIzru6pQiHi9FNWZ4W3Gx2a9uor.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Historia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1089598","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:34:44.545Z"},{"id":"movie-1735913","slug":"movie-1735913","title":"Kinofagia","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y0TJJMcTcr9aVK8vsVtuLLY8Pcx.jpg","synopsis":"En un búnker perdido en medio de un campo desolado, dos chicas pasan sus días aisladas del mundo. Su única compañía es una vieja televisión y una colección de cintas VHS que han convertido en su particular forma de sobrevivir.  Entre películas de guerra, violencia y muerte, han construido una rutina tan extraña como aparentemente normal. Pero a medida que las cintas empiezan a escasear, pequeñas grietas comienzan a aparecer en la relación entre ambas y en la realidad que las rodea.  *Kinofagia* es una historia sobre personas, aislamiento y la necesidad humana de encontrar algo al otro lado de una pantalla.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense","Película de TV"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1735913","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:34:44.895Z"},{"id":"movie-1239457","slug":"movie-1239457","title":"Subscriber","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tKLc2Of2248pfVrIOoftReClnTM.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1239457","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:34:45.248Z"},{"id":"movie-1571955","slug":"movie-1571955","title":"Colisión","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wnoCQo9N5m3ay00KRx20d4axRPJ.jpg","synopsis":"España, 2013. Tras atracar un banco, un fatal accidente de auto saca a la luz la cara oculta de una banda de ladrones y desvela que las traiciones comenzaron mucho antes del robo.","status":"Post Production","country":null,"genres":["Suspense","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1571955","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:34:45.596Z"},{"id":"movie-1620123","slug":"movie-1620123","title":"בחורים טובים 3","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/921SAfgngNp8Zr