l mayor traficante del mundo, y que dentro de 58 minutos aterrizará en Dulles en calidad de prisionero político. Stuart anula todos los sistemas que permiten aterrizar a los demás aviones, condenados a permanecer en el aire con el riesgo de agotárseles el combustible. Exige, además, que un Boeing 747 esté a su disposición para huir con el dictador una vez liberado, pero McClane intentará que no prospere...","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1573","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":1990,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:35:54.090Z"},{"id":"movie-1399253","slug":"movie-1399253","title":"Nosso Segredo","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9rH6PU8BduV9cdB6mjbsE51vb8M.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Fantasía"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1399253","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:35:54.460Z"},{"id":"movie-1652231","slug":"movie-1652231","title":"Apples & Pears","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wQQHzHC31aNFjmubOZIH0zXMBnB.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1652231","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:35:54.808Z"},{"id":"movie-1545975","slug":"movie-1545975","title":"Было не было","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a0YSlhDv5O3VQf0ZIKu525Iepdy.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1545975","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:35:55.332Z"},{"id":"movie-1757007","slug":"movie-1757007","title":"Kuru' Sumange'","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4TP3GC9HpBJKE6ST1W3ZM5M2m3.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Familia","Música"],"tot