2029. En una misión rutinaria, el astronauta Leo Davidson pierde el control de su nave y aterriza en un extraño planeta, habitado por una raza de simios de inteligencia similar a la de los humanos y que tratan a éstos como a animales. Con la ayuda de una chimpancé llamada Ari y de una pequeña banda de humanos rebeldes, Leo encabeza el enfrentamineto contra el terrible ejército dirigido por el general Thade y su hombre de confianza, el guerrero Attar. La clave es llegar a un templo sagrado que se encuentra en la zona prohibida del planeta.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Suspense","Ciencia ficción","Acción","Aventura"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/869","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2001,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:36:22.991Z"},{"id":"movie-1747479","slug":"movie-1747479","title":"Jayanti 2","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iCEud6JPS44RadgXoTgtwcWkhXW.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1747479","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:36:23.339Z"},{"id":"movie-1530096","slug":"movie-1530096","title":"Bloß nicht Liebe","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p5RxM5Z0YJdjVj2uDpunMF86bdo.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Romance","Película de TV","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1530096","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:36:23.692Z"},{"id":"movie-1602653","slug":"movie-1602653","title":"A Grand Biltmore Christmas","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8YnUZpsKKpMxY95jOzxwE09cXRD.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Post Production","country":null,"genres":["Romance","Fantasía","Película de TV"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1602653","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:36:24.188Z"},{"id":