,"synopsis":"Seis meses después de que la propagación del virus haya aniquilado las Islas Británicas, el ejército de los Estados Unidos declara que ha ganado la guerra contra la infección y que puede comenzar la reconstrucción del país. Con la primera ola de refugiados que vuelve al país, una familia consigue reencontrarse. Pero uno de los miembros guarda un terrible secreto sin ser consciente de ello. El virus aún no ha sido destruido y en esta ocasión, es más peligroso que nunca.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1562","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2007,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:38:25.721Z"},{"id":"movie-76492","slug":"movie-76492","title":"Hotel Transilvania","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zvWlwBGQWuJ0wog65q1uS37BApC.jpg","synopsis":"Drácula regenta un hotel en el que se alojan personajes como Frankenstein, la Momia, el Hombre Invisible, hombres-lobo... El problema del conde es que tiene una hija de espíritu aventurero a la que le resulta difícil controlar. El conflicto surge cuando se aloja en el hotel un ser humano que se siente atraído por la hija del dueño.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Comedia","Familia","Fantasía"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/76492","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2012,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:38:26.067Z"},{"id":"movie-1305642","slug":"movie-1305642","title":"焚城","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/13Odw0b5r32g4DAw3JSGGKOO1pu.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1305642","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2024,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:38:26.419Z"},{"id":"movie-1094473","slug":"movie-1094473","title":"Bambi, una vida en el bosque","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fvtIXQH4JcifptPe0J9GfLDIOAQ.jpg","synopsis":"Adaptación del libro “Bambi, la historia de una vida en el bosque” de Felix Salten, la película cuenta las aventuras de un joven cervatillo, rodeado de su madre y de los animales del bosque: su amigo el cuervo, el conejo, el mapache... Descubre el mundo de los árboles y sus secretos. Cada día, su madre lo educa para que pueda crecer fuerte. Pero cuando llega el otoño, Bambi se aventura a la intemperie cuando los cazadores lo separan para siempre de su madre.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Documental","Familia","Aventura"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1094473","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2024,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:38:26.770Z"},{"id":"movie-681434","slug":"movie-681434","title":"Psycho Therapy: The Shallow Tale of a Writer Who Decided to Write About a Serial Killer","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fZgUmTyDiDLeKOlUKXnOs1GKe3b.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Crimen","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/681434","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:38:27.124Z"},{"id":"movie-1001374","slug":"movie-1001374","title":"Les Arènes","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uxmUQnkU4cCyx0JAEdSw9f3eERi.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1001374","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:38:27.476Z"},{"id":"movie-1597535","slug":"movie-1597535","title":"Breast Friends Forever","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yPmDphwliH7vOhYssfX9E9J5qOl.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1597535","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:38:27.835Z"},{"id":"movie-1254624","slug":"movie-1254624","title":"La noche si