o de la tecnología, y de Abigail Chase, la atractiva conservadora de los Archivos Nacionales.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Acción","Misterio"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/2059","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2004,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:39:35.502Z"},{"id":"movie-1624564","slug":"movie-1624564","title":"Libang Libu","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l0BJfhS4CH5FCbL2WUQqaOWmRWi.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1624564","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:39:35.850Z"},{"id":"movie-794","slug":"movie-794","title":"La profecía","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iWyb6PKnl7lp0ytK8ZG7vJloGxc.jpg","synopsis":"Cuando Kathy Thorn da a luz a un bebé muerto, su esposo Robert le oculta la verdad y sustituye a su hijo por un niño huérfano, ignorando su origen satánico. El horror empieza cuando, en el quinto cumpleaños de Damien, inesperadamente, su niñera se suicida. Un sacerdote que trata de advertir a Robert del peligro que corre, muere en un inesperado accidente. El creciente número de muertes hace que Robert, por fin, se dé cuenta de que el niño que han adoptado es el Anticristo, y que hay que matarlo para impedir que se cumpla una terrible profecía.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/794","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":1976,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:39:36.199Z"},{"id":"movie-1380718","slug":"movie-1380718","title":"Molepeople","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2bRAPgnp0xBwPXCX5WfGTEAOs3v.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Planned","country":null,"genres":["Terror"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1380718","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2027,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:39:36.549Z"},{"